is grandmother sits with him at the table. \"Count your fingers,\" she says. Nam counts one, two, three, four, five. Then he stops. \"How many fingers on two hands?\" asks his grandmother. Nam thinks. He counts again: six, seven, eight, nine, ten. \"Ten!\" he says. His grandmother smiles. They go to the park. Nam sees three birds in the tree. He sees two dogs near the gate. He sees one big cat on the wall. \"Three and two and one make six animals,\" says Nam. His grandmother claps her hands. \"Very good!\" On the way home they buy six oranges. Nam carries the bag. At home he gives one orange to his mother and one to his father. \"Now we have four oranges,\" he says. \"Two for today, and two for tomorrow.\"", "dich": {"Nam is six years old.": "Nam sáu tuổi.", "Today he learns to count.": "Hôm nay bạn ấy học đếm.", "His grandmother sits with him at the table.": "Bà ngồi cùng bạn ấy ở bàn.", "\"Count your fingers,\" she says.": "\"Đếm ngón tay con đi,\" bà nói.", "Nam counts one, two, three, four, five.": "Nam đếm một, hai, ba, bốn, năm.", "Then he stops.": "Rồi bạn ấy dừng lại.", "\"How many fingers on two hands?\" asks his grandmother.": "\"Hai bàn tay có mấy ngón?\" bà hỏi.", "Nam thinks.": "Nam nghĩ.", "He counts again: six, seven, eight, nine, ten.": "Bạn ấy đếm tiếp: sáu, bảy, tám, chín, mười.", "\"Ten!\" he says.": "\"Mười ạ!\" bạn ấy nói.", "His grandmother smiles.": "Bà mỉm cười.", "They go to the park.": "Hai bà cháu ra công viên.", "Nam sees three birds in the tree.": "Nam thấy ba con chim trên cây.", "He sees two dogs near the gate.": "Bạn ấy thấy hai con chó gần cổng.", "He sees one big cat on the wall.": "Bạn ấy thấy một con mèo to trên tường.", "\"Three and two and one make six animals,\" says Nam.": "\"Ba với hai với một là sáu con vật,\" Nam nói.", "His grandmother claps her hands.": "Bà vỗ tay.", "\"Very good!\"": "\"Giỏi lắm!\"", "On the way home they buy six oranges.": "Trên đường về hai bà cháu mua sáu quả cam.", "Nam carries the bag.": "Nam xách túi.", "At home he gives one orange to his mother and one to his father.": "Về nhà bạn ấy đưa một quả cho mẹ và một quả cho bố.", "\"Now we have four oranges,\" he says.": "\"Giờ nhà mình còn bốn quả,\" bạn ấy nói.", "\"Two for today, and two for tomorrow.\"": "\"Hai quả cho hôm nay, hai quả để mai.\""}, "cau": [{"en": "Nam is six years old.", "pa": {"cau": "Nam is six years old.", "ipa_day_du": "/næm/ /ɪz/ /sɪks/ /jɪəz/ /njuː/", "ipa_noi": "/næm‿ɪz sɪks‿jɪəz njuː/", "tho_noi": "nam-iz-siks-yiaz-nyu", "tu": [{"tu": "Nam", "ipa": "næm", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "is", "ipa": "ɪz", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "six", "ipa": "sɪks", "nguon": "giao_trinh"}, {"tu": "years", "ipa": "jɪəz", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "old", "ipa": "njuː", "nguon": "giao_trinh"}]}, "vi": "Nam sáu tuổi."}, {"en": "Today he learns to count.", "pa": {"cau": "Today he learns to count.", "ipa_day_du": "/təˈdeɪ/ /hiː/ /lɜːnz/ /tuː/ /kaʊnt/", "ipa_noi": "/təˈdeɪ i lɜːnz tə kaʊnt/", "tho_noi": "tơdây-i-lơnz-tơ-kaont", "tu": [{"tu": "Today", "ipa": "təˈdeɪ", "nguon": "giao_trinh"}, {"tu": "he", "ipa": "hiː", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "learns", "ipa": "lɜːnz", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "to", "ipa": "tuː", "nguon": "giao_trinh"}, {"tu": "count", "ipa": "kaʊnt", "nguon": "giao_trinh"}]}, "vi": "Hôm nay bạn ấy học đếm."}, {"en": "His grandmother sits with him at the table.", "pa": {"cau": "His grandmother sits with him at the table.", "ipa_day_du": "/hɪz/ /ˈɡrænmʌðə/ /sɪts/ /wɪð/ /hɪm/ /æt/ /ðə/ /ˈteɪbl/", "ipa_noi": "/hɪz ˈɡrænmʌðə sɪts‿wɪð‿ɪm‿ət ðə ˈteɪbl/", "tho_noi": "hiz-granmâdhơ-sits-widh-im-ơt-dhơ-tâybl", "tu": [{"tu": "His", "ipa": "hɪz", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "grandmother", "ipa": "ˈɡrænmʌðə", "nguon": "giao_trinh"}, {"tu": "sits", "ipa": "sɪts", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "with", "ipa": "wɪð", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "him", "ipa": "hɪm", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "at", "ipa": "æt", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "the", "ipa": "ðə", "nguon": "cmu"}, {"tu": "table", "ipa": "ˈteɪbl", "nguon": "giao_trinh"}]}, "vi": "Bà 